{"title":"Easter Wreath","slug":"Easter_Wreath","pageid":1513,"revid":21261,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T06:02:57Z","lastEditor":"Maxwell Games 3","categories":["Items","Limited","Event_Items","Decorative_Item"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Hop 'N' Shop"},{"label":"Price","value":"🥚25"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.5.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"09/04/2023"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"history","text":"History"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p><i><big>\"<b>Add decor to your new home! New? Why is it new...?</b>\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Easter Wreath</b> is a decoration item that is no longer available for purchase. It was added April 4, 2023, as part of the <span title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>. It was able to be purchased from the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggstatic_Hop_Shop/\">Hop 'N' Shop</a> for <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>25.\n</p><p>The wreath is made of a green grass-like material, decorated in differently colored easter eggs and pink-petaled flowers.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"history\">History</h2>\n<ul><li>Was added in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Version_1.5.0/\">Version 1.5.0</a>, on the <span title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>;</li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals/\">Eggtastic Hop Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals/\">Eggcelent Deals</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, the price has been changed from <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>75 to $10,110;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hop_'N'_Shop/\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>, the price has been changed from <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>75 to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>25.</li></ul>\n\n</div>"}
